036","block":"b-4bbfe7fb10e5f8762a6c","layer":"original","quote":"及曹公克荆州，假行裨将军〖2〗；仍就故任〖3〗，统属长沙太守韩玄。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":37,"end":70},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o036","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-4bbfe7fb10e5f8762a6c","layer":"original","quote":"黄忠字汉升，南阳人也。荆州牧刘表以为中郎将；与表从子磐共守长沙攸县〖1〗。及曹公克荆州，假行裨将军〖2〗；仍就故任〖3〗，统属长沙太守韩玄。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o030b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-eb597d5d4ba0ca04fe0c","layer":"original","quote":"又南征四郡〖1〗：武陵太守金旋、长沙太守韩玄、桂阳太守赵范、零陵太守刘度〖2〗，皆降。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":10,"end":56},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o030","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-eb597d5d4ba0ca04fe0c","layer":"original","quote":"先主表琦为荆州刺史；又南征四郡〖1〗：武陵太守金旋、长沙太守韩玄、桂阳太守赵范、零陵太守刘度〖2〗，皆降。﹝一﹞庐江雷绪率部曲数万口稽颡〖3〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p030-jinxuan","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-27b35ca21b7ccf80c266","layer":"pei","quote":"为备所攻劫，死。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2f79d10a3c631a893cc7","start":50,"end":58}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
